{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Corporate Memphis (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corporate_Memphis\" title=\"Corporate Memphis\">Corporate Memphis</a></b> <i>(example pictured)</i> is featured on the new <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canadian_passport\" title=\"Canadian passport\">Canadian passport</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corporate_Memphis","retrieved":1786731921991},{"title":"Salem Moon (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that drag performer <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiba_Walker\" title=\"Kiba Walker\">Salem Moon</a></b> raised $9,500 for LGBTQ+ youth after an anti-LGBTQ organization targeted her trivia-night event?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiba_Walker","retrieved":1786731921991},{"title":"Hongwu era (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that numerous political purges during the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongwu_era\" title=\"Hongwu era\">Hongwu era</a></b> resulted in the deaths of tens of thousands of people?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongwu_era","retrieved":1786731921993},{"title":"a New York City mansion (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schinasi_House\" title=\"Schinasi House\">a New York City mansion</a></b> once had a tunnel to the Hudson River?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schinasi_House","retrieved":1786731921993},{"title":"Aru Kararu no Isan (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the 1993 Japanese anime OVA <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aru_Kararu_no_Isan\" title=\"Aru Kararu no Isan\">Aru Kararu no Isan</a></b></i>, despite not having a conclusive ending, has been praised by critics for its use of science-fiction concepts?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aru_Kararu_no_Isan","retrieved":1786731921994},{"title":"Anthony Carl Knudsen (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anthony_Carl_Knudsen\" title=\"Anthony Carl Knudsen\">Anthony Carl Knudsen</a></b> served in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minnesota_House_of_Representatives\" title=\"Minnesota House of Representatives\">Minnesota House of Representatives</a> for more than eight years, despite arriving in Minnesota as \"nothing more nor less than a tramp\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anthony_Carl_Knudsen","retrieved":1786731921995},{"title":"NCDV (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that an <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Centre_for_Domestic_Violence\" title=\"National Centre for Domestic Violence\">NCDV</a></b> campaign to raise awareness of domestic violence during the 2018 FIFA World Cup won a gold prize at the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannes_Lions\" title=\"Cannes Lions\">Cannes Lions Festival of Creativity</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Centre_for_Domestic_Violence","retrieved":1786731921996},{"title":"Kalorama Park and Archeological Site (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalorama_Park_and_Archeological_Site\" title=\"Kalorama Park and Archeological Site\">Kalorama Park and Archeological Site</a></b> in Washington, D.C., is included in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Underground_Railroad#National_Underground_Railroad_Network\" title=\"Underground Railroad\">National Underground Railroad Network to Freedom</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalorama_Park_and_Archeological_Site","retrieved":1786731921998},{"title":"Harry Game (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b